step Marshal Windsor
  zone map 1428
  tip Windsor is locked in a cell in the Detention Block of Blackrock Depths, at the start of the instance. · You only need to talk to him, not free him. · A rogue can pick the lock, or loot the Prison Cell Key from High Interrogator Gerstahn (the first boss, in the same area) and open the door. · ~5,450 XP.
  turnin 4241 "Marshal Windsor"

