step Dungeons (Blackrock Mountain is between here and Searing Gorge)
  zone map 1427
  tip 52-60. · One run now for XP while you're next door (Marshal Windsor + Incendius are in here). · Both are inside the mountain on the way to BRD. · Grab them on your first BRD/LBRS run. · 55-60, so save the full run for the Lv 60 sweep. · Grab the LBRS quests at Morgan's Vigil when you're back.
  task "Blackrock Depths (52-60)" optional
  task "Magma or Lava? + Stonewrought Design" optional
  task "Lower Blackrock Spire (55-60)" optional

